<view class="container {{themeClass}} features-page">
  <custom-nav title="更多" />
  <view class="page-head">
    <view class="page-title">更多</view>
    <view class="page-sub">日历在左侧 Tab · 点这里进入各模块</view>
  </view>

  <view class="error-text" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>

  <view class="feature-list">
    <view class="feature-card" wx:for="{{featureList}}" wx:key="key" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="onOpenFeature">
      <view class="fe-icon ic-{{item.key}}">{{item.icon}}</view>
      <view class="fe-body">
        <view class="fe-label">{{item.label}}</view>
        <view class="fe-sub">{{item.sub}}</view>
      </view>
      <text class="fe-arrow">›</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tip-card">
    <view class="tip-title">💡 小贴士</view>
    <view class="tip-text">在“日历”里点某一天，可以直接为该天添加菜单、下馆子行程、旅行行程或纪念日。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="tip-card">
    <view class="toggle-row">
      <view>
        <view class="tip-title">🎨 随时节自动换肤</view>
        <view class="tip-text">跟随二十四节气与昼夜自动切换配色；关闭后锁定基础风格</view>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{themeAuto}}" bindchange="onToggleTheme" color="#F08A9B" />
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
